'''Visa requirements for Indian citizens''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other countries placed on citizens of [[India]].

As of 2026, Indian citizens has access to 27 visa-free, 47 visa-on-arrival and 66 e-visa countries<ref>{{Cite news |title=Visa facility for Indian Nationals (ordinary passport){{!}}  Ministry of External Affairs |url=https://www.mea.gov.in/VFFIN.htm |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251013183415/https://www.mea.gov.in/VFFIN.htm |archive-date=13 October 2025 |access-date=2026-01-20 |work=Ministry of External Affairs, Government of India |language=en-US |url-status=live }}</ref> as per [[Ministry of External Affairs (India)|Ministry Of External Affairs]], [[Government of India|Government Of India]].

