[[Kyrgyzstan]] introduced online visitor visas in September 2017 (but they send an email after the application requiring a Letter of Invitation from a Tour company which costs at least USD 50), and Armenia in November 2017.<ref name=":0">{{cite web | url=http://arminfo.info/mvfull_news.php?id=28226&lang=2 | title=Армения либерализует визовый режим с Индией (Armenia liberalizes visa regime with India) | access-date=2023-12-30 | date=2017-11-15}}</ref>

Indian citizens already in possession of a valid [[UK]], [[United States]], [[Canada]] or [[Schengen Area|Schengen]] visa became eligible to apply for a visa on arrival to [[Oman]] in October 2017,<ref>{{cite news | date=2017-10-06 | title=Oman Announces Visa On Arrival Scheme For Indians | work=Little India: Overseas Indian, NRI, Asian Indian, Indian American | url=http://littleindia.com/oman-announces-visa-arrival-scheme-indians/ | access-date=2017-12-16}}</ref> [[Armenia]] in November 2017,<ref name=":0" /> and [[Chile]] (US visa only) in April 2019.<ref name=":3" />
|}

